  "implementationRules": [
    "Rust owns durable identity, selection, graph layout, diff and staging semantics, operation state, persistence and background work.",
    "Flutter renders bounded projections, restores focus by stable identity and never keeps durable row state.",
    "Widgets read colours, spacing, radii and motion only from GitLamaTheme and AppTokens, which are derived from tokens/gitlama-tokens.json.",
    "Icons come only from the Lucide 1.37.0 set in assets/icons/lucide."
  ],
